  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_6f93d57989544af49c8650048226eefb",
      "statement": "The monorepo contains five packages: kit (core), kit-ng (Angular adapter), kit-react (React adapter with /next subpath), kit-vue (Vue adapter with /nuxt subpath), and cli (rhc infrastructure-as-code tooling). All share the same version and are released together.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/cli/package.json",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:08bb2546a3b324bb438e7e95a8bf9acc237befc1688d2bf055e8d4dc6a109c85"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/kit/src/index.ts",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:b39b338894832a31d917234a39afb2b950198b72952b55a3cd0efeb3495427e0"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ae678a31e16d483f9c22394edd045724",
      "statement": "The monorepo follows a strict layered architecture: Layer 1 is @restheart-cloud/kit (core, zero dependencies, framework-agnostic), Layer 2 is the framework adapters (kit-ng, kit-react, kit-vue) that depend on kit and add reactive wrappers, and Layer 3 is @restheart-cloud/cli which depends on kit for apiFetch and token utilities but is not an adapter.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/cli/package.json#L35-L37",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1224e1299300a630cadbb42da4929c1ede5f90a6fa9d82e62b74d829b72d7e34:"
        },
        {
