          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:bd42a578b36eec44017c36029375a44d34e1289b209bb585a77dac7a9e3bcc9b:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/kit/src/index.ts",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:b39b338894832a31d917234a39afb2b950198b72952b55a3cd0efeb3495427e0"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_38249586080a411984b27433f956e7ff",
      "statement": "The CLI's AdminClient authenticates against the admin node (cloud-api.restheart.com), manages plugins (install, configure, init, test), mints service tokens, and stores credentials in a closure rather than localStorage to support Node.js and avoid cross-client token collision.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/cli/src/admin.ts#L131-L236",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:c24e0d02c7931797fd41445b62296813a6cc24cd04cb127e111f127623e45b3f:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/cli/src/cli.ts#L18-L18",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:42bcb6ba35362a535bdedd09e759272c653a6f88f1f7b625b00ee8e2ca2f3b50:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_a59f35d418ac4117a9a4f74d9f7e9bba",
      "statement": "The CLI's ServiceClient authenticates against a service node using a token minted lazily from the admin client's /jwt endpoint, caches it, and renews it one minute before expiry. It provides idempotent operations for collections, indexes, permissions, users, and schemas, using ?wm=upsert for document PUTs.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/cli/src/service.ts#L42-L56",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2b7b75eb030bdb6b362fc2997fc832629a77aa571bf98a028970972c18e010d6:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/cli/src/service.ts#L57-L177",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:752102d210e60d8e8d5799079534c169d4b959a00ac31eaabf683e07c6ba7d64:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_2d8b7076953f4976b6db33d29370588f",
      "statement": "The CLI's setup runner (runSetup) executes steps sequentially, halting on failure. Each step has a check (is it already done?) and an apply (make it so). After applying, it re-checks with exponential backoff up to 15 seconds to handle admin-node/service-node propagation lag. Dry runs execute all checks without applying. The force option skips checks but still verifies the result.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/cli/src/setup.ts#L108-L246",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5e9c3c2f5a4f4bc312466076c355a39c0d82d1404bb32db5615aec3e3168155f:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/cli/src/setup.ts#L155-L189",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:20313f7492339f3f54245381fa26a4ab4d06a621d000ba01dbc0e16e869e2a51:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f613d76a3f7247388da0b9973bc6768d",
      "statement": "The CLI stores personal access tokens in ~/.config/restheart/session.json (or XDG_CONFIG_HOME) with 0600 permissions. The RH_CLOUD_TOKEN environment variable always takes precedence over the stored session, ensuring CI pipelines never silently use a stale credential.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/cli/src/cli.ts#L98-L98",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:33b92924ac11463bc659d75fddad096e998adf9c4b261480e647ccf06f41181c:"
