    {
      "id": "claim_4fb378c7ad39421f97559efa5f4fb0ef",
      "statement": "Payments are a separate reactive surface from auth in every SPA adapter: RhPaymentsService (Angular), usePayments() under RhPaymentsProvider (React), usePayments() under createRhPayments (Vue). Each owns subscription, plan, isSubscribed, canManageBilling, seatsAvailable and reads the user from the auth surface only to derive canManageBilling.",
      "evidence": [
