    {
      "id": "claim_415ca7cb165f42b8b6c224634c21ad68",
      "statement": "The CLI is not a framework adapter — it is a standalone operational tool that runs in Node.js. It depends on kit for apiFetch, login, and token utilities (getTokenExpiry) but does not wrap them in reactive state or framework-specific patterns.",
